            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick an enemy **^^Hero^^** in combat with the caster to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Inflict D3 mortal damage on the target. If the target is destroyed by this spell, add 1 to this unit&apos;s power level for the rest of the battle.</characteristic>
