          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit is not in combat, each time a model in this unit is slain by a shooting attack and that model was within 12&quot; of the attacking unit, roll a dice. Add 2 to the roll if the attacking unit was a **^^Monster^^**. On a 4+, inflict D6 mortal damage on the attacking unit after the **^^Shoot^^** ability has been resolved.</characteristic>
